		height: 50px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		margin-bottom: 6px;
	}

	.member-avatar-image {
		width: 50px;
		height: 50px;
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.member-avatar-text {
		color: #FFFFFF;
		font-size: 14px;
